(7209249, 1109292, 60173, '<td valign="top">What?! This was by far the winner for me. I really appreciated that you did something different than the rest of us uncreative schlubs (no idea what that word means, just made it up!). This was a really cute idea and well executed. It''s a nice score, but you deserve the blue for this.</td>', 'What?! This was by far the winner for me. I really appreciated that you did something different than the rest of us uncreative schlubs (no idea what that word means, just made it up!). This was a really cute idea and well executed. It''s a nice score, but you deserve the blue for this.', '2014-04-28 03:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7209253, 1109488, 129807, '<td valign="top">Hahahaaaa. You never even saw it! LOL. Congrats on your new Blue - nice sleight of hand. ;)</td>', 'Hahahaaaa. You never even saw it! LOL. Congrats on your new Blue - nice sleight of hand. ;)', '2014-04-28 03:56:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7209256, 1109301, 129807, '<td valign="top">Well just lookee at your TT! Keep this up mate and you''ll be a ribbon hawg in no time.... congrats. That broccoli hasn''t gone yet though.... ;D</td>', 'Well just lookee at your TT! Keep this up mate and you''ll be a ribbon hawg in no time.... congrats. That broccoli hasn''t gone yet though.... ;D', '2014-04-28 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
