(7209316, 1109488, 68020, '<td valign="top">The best looking blood moon of the lot! Congrats!!</td>', 'The best looking blood moon of the lot! Congrats!!', '2014-04-28 08:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7209379, 1109488, 54446, '<td valign="top">But, you didn''t photograph the lunar eclipse.  It''s a much different ballgame than photographing the bright full moon.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon, but it truly doesn''t meet the challenge.  You''ve done a good job of turning a full moon red.  But, that''s not the way a total lunar eclipse looks.  I guess no one seems to care.  So, more power to you!</td>', 'But, you didn''t photograph the lunar eclipse.  It''s a much different ballgame than photographing the bright full moon.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon, but it truly doesn''t meet the challenge.  You''ve done a good job of turning a full moon red.  But, that''s not the way a total lunar eclipse looks.  I guess no one seems to care.  So, more power to you!', '2014-04-28 10:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7209412, 1109488, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> But, you didn''t photograph the lunar eclipse.  It''s a much different ballgame than photographing the bright full moon.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon, but it truly doesn''t meet the challenge.  You''ve done a good job of turning a full moon red.  But, that''s not the way a total lunar eclipse looks.  I guess no one seems to care.  So, more power to you! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was sure that not everyone would like my attempt. I''m honest and I wanted to say what the truth was. If Langdon had chosen a more generic challenge title I wouldn''t need to turn the moon red. The challenge was really US-centric IMO. In any case if someone is upset with my image I really apologize.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: But, you didn''t photograph the lunar eclipse.  It''s a much different ballgame than photographing the bright full moon.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon, but it truly doesn''t meet the challenge.  You''ve done a good job of turning a full moon red.  But, that''s not the way a total lunar eclipse looks.  I guess no one seems to care.  So, more power to you!   I was sure that not everyone would like my attempt. I''m honest and I wanted to say what the truth was. If Langdon had chosen a more generic challenge title I wouldn''t need to turn the moon red. The challenge was really US-centric IMO. In any case if someone is upset with my image I really apologize.', '2014-04-28 11:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7209434, 1109461, 112739, '<td valign="top">A very great image of the real eclipse without any fancy PS touch up. It appears to be floating to my eye. Great natural tonality. Congrats on the red!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-05-01 17:36:05.</i></td>', 'A very great image of the real eclipse without any fancy PS touch up. It appears to be floating to my eye. Great natural tonality. Congrats on the red!', '2014-04-28 13:26:44.000000', '2014-05-01 18:36:05.000000', 0),
(7209435, 1109488, 153814, '<td valign="top">Looks better than the real thing.<br/> <br/>Congrats.</td>', 'Looks better than the real thing. Congrats.', '2014-04-28 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
